    answer: >-
      Yes. A friend, family member or adviser can help, or fill it in with
      you. Free help is available from Citizens Advice and local welfare
      rights services.
  - question: Will my PIP be backdated?
    answer: >-
      If you are awarded PIP, it is paid from the date you started your claim
      (usually the date of your first call), as long as you send the form back
      on time.
